        &\|Y_{k}^{(t+1)} - \bar{y}_{k}^{(t+1)}\mathbf{1}^{\top}\|^2 \leq \frac{(1+\rho^2)}{2}\|Y_k^{(t)} - \bar{y}_k^{(t)}\mathbf{1}^{\top}\|^2 + \beta_k^2\frac{1+\rho^2}{1-\rho^2}\|V_k^{(t)} - \bar{v}_k^{(t)}\mathbf{1}^{\top}\|^2. \end{align}
    The inequalities hold similarly as the inequality in \eqref{ineq: consensus_ineq}.

Notice that we have
    \begin{align*}
